remarks:
The visit will comprise:

•	meeting with the Head of Sixth Form, Miss Georgina Dore;
•	tour of the school with one of our students during which they will meet a Housemaster;
•	meeting with the Headmaster, Mr Peter Green.

Maps of the area and the campus sent. You may park your car in the designated parking bays on the left hand side of the main walkway in front of the main school building.  A member of staff will meet you in the archway (numbered 2 on the attached map) between the Chapel and the Dining Hall five minutes prior to their appointment. If you are likely to arrive early, or late, please telephone to let the school know.
